m_assets/steam/apps/888130/extras/9e11cdd5b523a90f0e0e13dcc660610b.webm?t=1608783700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/888130/extras/9e11cdd5b523a90f0e0e13dcc660610b.mp4?t=1608783700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sandbox Mode</h2>Take your time and explore all that the galaxy has to offer in Zen Mode. Build at your own pace, upgrading and expanding your space city as you go. Or perhaps you\u2019re looking for something a bit more challenging? Try out Hard Mode, where we throw all of the perils of the game your way and it\u2019s up to you to survive.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/888130/extras/b1cf24e7fc61a146928432a37f2e73b7.poster.avif?t=1608783700\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/888130/extras/b1cf24e7fc61a146928432a37f2e73b7.webm?t=1608783700\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/888130/extras/b1cf24e7fc61a146928432a37f2e73b7.mp4?t=1608783700\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique upgrades</h2>Upgrades to your station happen organically through proximity. Grouping three power plants in a cluster will supply a larger area with power and require less maintenance, as well as linking together their structural integrity. Design your own unique station layouts by exploring the variety of different upgrades and the impact they each have.",
